<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Bundesliga matches</p>
<p>played on Saturday:</p>
<p>St Pauli 2 (Pisarew 22nd minute, Driller 79th) Freiburg 0.</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 19,901.</p>
<p>Borussia Moenchengladbach 2 (Kastenmaier 57th, Villa 70th)</p>
<p>Hansa Rostock 0. 0-0. 25,500.</p>
<p>Karlsruhe 1 (Haessler 43rd) Werder Bremen 3 (Pfeifenberger</p>
<p>63rd, Labbadia 75th, Herzog 80th). 1-0. 22,500.</p>
<p>Schalke 2 (Wilmots 28th, Dooley 66th) Hamburg 0. 1-0. 32,600.</p>
<p>Arminia Bielefeld (Breitkreuz 53rd) Cologne 4 (Polster 19th,</p>
<p>Schmidt 49th, Vladoiu 75th, Gaissmayer 89th). 0-1. 22,512.</p>
<p>MSV Duisburg 0 Fortuna Duesseldorf 0. 19,500.</p>
